{
  "id": "p35",
  "title": "The Rocket Club Merger",
  "titleZh": "火箭俱乐部的合并",
  "topic": "矿区青年俱乐部合并",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My youth club will join a team at the mine site.",
        "zh": "我的青年俱乐部将和矿区的一支队伍合并。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A million dollars would help, but the recession hurt our export trade.",
        "zh": "一百万美元会有帮助，可经济衰退伤了我们的出口生意。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The foundation sends a warm offer, and the terms are positive.",
        "zh": "基金会发来一份热忱的提议，条款也很积极。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Thus our members assume the plan is a fair chance.",
        "zh": "于是会员们认为这计划是个公平的机会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A retired miner brings a classic model rocket to the crowded hall.",
        "zh": "一位退休矿工把一枚经典的模型火箭带进拥挤的大厅。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a singer performs, and the mood turns spiritual.",
        "zh": "接着一位歌手登台，气氛变得有灵性。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An organized launch will inform every resident near the gate.",
        "zh": "一次有组织的发射会让大门附近的每位居民都知情。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The output depends on a consistent fuel pattern.",
        "zh": "产出取决于稳定的燃料配比。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Pressure builds inside the pipe, and we check the valve.",
        "zh": "压力在管道里积聚，我们去检查阀门。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A newly built shelter can halt the wind and protect the crowd.",
        "zh": "一座新建的棚子能挡住风，护住人群。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The site has a provision for clean water and a small first aid kit.",
        "zh": "场地备有干净水源，还有一个小急救箱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We vary the schedule and emphasize safety at each step.",
        "zh": "我们调整日程，并在每一步强调安全。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A comment from the chief is calm, and our moral is strong.",
        "zh": "负责人的一句评论很平静，我们的士气也很足。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A wild fire starts near the fence, and the alarm screams.",
        "zh": "栅栏附近起了野火，警报尖叫起来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The members flee, and a retired fighter leads them out.",
        "zh": "会员们逃开，一位退役拳手带他们出去。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then smoke covers the site, and we stare at the flame.",
        "zh": "接着烟雾盖住场地，我们盯着火焰。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The fire crew hunts every spark in the wild grass.",
        "zh": "消防队在野草里搜寻每一颗火星。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A punch of wind sends a metal item flying.",
        "zh": "一阵风的重击把一件金属物品吹得飞了起来。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A racial word on the wall causes a formal complaint.",
        "zh": "墙上的一句种族言论引来正式投诉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Self belief is crucial, and we resolve not to harass anyone.",
        "zh": "自信至关重要，我们决心不骚扰任何人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The seventeenth amendment to our rules is read aloud.",
        "zh": "章程的第十七条修正案被大声宣读。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The personnel office must check every printed item in the code.",
        "zh": "人事办公室必须核对守则里每一条印出来的规定。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My club feels the strain when the guilty member leaves.",
        "zh": "那名有罪的会员离开时，我的俱乐部感到深深的紧绷。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later an auction raises a million for a new launch pad.",
        "zh": "后来一场拍卖为新的发射台筹到一百万美元。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A corporation offers compensation and a chance to promote sport.",
        "zh": "一家公司提供补偿，也给了推广运动的机会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The merger brings a remarkable change, and the club stays strong.",
        "zh": "合并带来显著的变化，俱乐部依然坚强。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My role is to note the possibility of a second trial.",
        "zh": "我的职责是点明再试一次的可能性。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A new foundation will support the club through the depression.",
        "zh": "一个新的基金会将陪俱乐部度过这场萧条。"
      }
    ]
  ],
